       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "Logical model representing the nursing assessment questionnaire for home hospitalization patients receiving Trastuzumab. This questionnaire is filled in by the home nurse during each visit and exchanged as a FHIR QuestionnaireResponse with the hospital. Specific features: includes body weight, aftercare/reaction monitoring, and cardiac-focused contraindication checklist." ]
